                            <div class="code-body" style="padding: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">
<span class="comment">// Simple UTXO spend</span>
<span class="keyword">Version:</span> <span class="number">0x02</span>

<span class="keyword">Input:</span> <span class="variable">UTXO</span> + <span class="function">ECDSA sig</span>

<span class="keyword">Output:</span> <span class="type">P2PKH</span>/<span class="type">P2TR</span> address

<span class="comment">// Characteristics</span>
<span class="string">Immediate execution</span>
<span class="string">No time-locks</span>
<span class="string">Simple signature</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card animate-fade-in-up" style="transition-delay: 0.2s; border: 2px solid var(--dd-gold);">
                        <h3 class="text-gold mb-2">DD Redemption TX</h3>
